  "worked_solution": "To multiply two fractions, we multiply the numerators, and we multiply the denominators:\n\n$$\n\\frac{7}{2}\\times \\frac{9}{4}=\\frac{7\\times 9}{2\\times 4}=\\frac{63}{8}\n$$",
